Z||000000||Brian84SE||05-09-2000||09:47 AM||||I am still searching for the elusive actuator. I am laying on the passenger side looking up...I see the blue chime module and the speaker is up behind it.  Guide me from here.....||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||05-09-2000||01:48 PM||||You need a flash light. from the passenger side, look between the bottom of the duct work and the top of the fuel tank tunnel. I could only see part of it when I looked, but I was in good clothes at the time. So I couldn't crawl under.<P>If you are facing the radio dead on, it's down and I think to the left of the one behind the radio. It looked like the top side of the thing faces the pasenger side. looks about the same as the other one, just wired diferant inside it.<P>Getting the link clip off and on once you get the screws out will not be fun. Depending on just what position it died in there may not be allot of play in the linkage.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 05-09-2000).]||||reg||1
